Modifications in HandScoreCore relative to the upstream AnemllCore:

- The Swift module name was renamed from `AnemllCore` to `HandScoreCore` and
  the package was repackaged as a standalone local SwiftPM package under
  NPUBench/HandScoreCore/ so the HAND-Score iOS benchmark app can be built
  without the surrounding ANEMLL repository.
- A per-file attribution header was prepended to each .swift source file to
  preserve the link to the upstream project.
- No functional changes were made to the runtime logic.
